Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:34.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《回到未来》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:20.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(布朗的宅邸被拆毁)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:23.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(布朗的财产卖给了开发商)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:33.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十月是清点货物换季的时节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}October is inventory time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在丰田汽车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so right now, Statler Toyota{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正在降价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is making the best deals of the year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:39.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你再也找不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on all 1985-model Toyotas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比丰田1985更好的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find a better car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:44.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,价钱便宜 服务周到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a better price with better service anywhere in Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是山谷镇的丰田{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Statler Toyota in downtown Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:53.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,参议院今天将对此投票表决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Senate is expected to vote on this today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:57.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其他方面新闻 太平洋核子研究所的高级官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In other news, officials at the Pacific Nuclear research facility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:00.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否认了两周前 一箱装有核材料钚的箱子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have denied the rumor that a case of missing plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:03.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在保险箱中被人盗走的传闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was in fact stolen from their vault two weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:06.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而一利比亚恐怖组织声称{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Libyan terrorist group had claimed responsibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:07.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对此偷盗事件负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the alleged theft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:09.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而 该高级官员却说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, officials now attribute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:12.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完全是清点错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the discrepancy to a simple clerical error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:16.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,调查此事的FBI 目前没有表态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The FBI, which is investigating the matter, had no comment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(狗食)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(爱因斯坦)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:02:59.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 有人在家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello! Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦 到这来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein, come here, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了? 老天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闻起来真恶心! 他在哪啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is disgusting. Where the hell is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(钚 小心搬运)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摇滚起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock 'n' roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:53.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 博士 你在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey, Doc. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 总算找到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God I've found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:59.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你可否在凌晨 1:15到"双松购物超市"来见我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, can you meet me at Twin Pines Mall tonight at 1:15?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有了新突破 需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made a major breakthrough, and I'll need your assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 凌晨 1:15?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. 1:15 in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:03.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 整整一星期你去哪了? - 工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you been all week? - Working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:08.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦呢? 和你在一起吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Einstein? Is he with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 它就在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你的仪器整个星期都是开着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Doc, you left your equipment on all week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的仪器? 我告诉你 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My equipment. That reminds me, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:17.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别接通那个扩音器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better not hook up to the amplifier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会超载的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a slight possibility of overload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我记住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'll keep that in mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 咱们晚上见 别忘了是凌晨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I'll see you tonight. Don't forget now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:27.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1:15 双胞胎松林购物广场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1:15 a.m., Twin Pines Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:36.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌敲钟声!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those my clocks I hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 8点正了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's 8:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我迟到了! 我还得工作呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect! My experiment worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的钟都整整慢了 25 分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all exactly 25 minutes slow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:47.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Wait a minute, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 现在是 8:25 ?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me that it's 8:25?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死! 我上学要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! I'm late for school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:58.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(钚 小心搬运)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(山谷镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:47.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(请投现任市长 戈尔迪·威尔逊 一票)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 詹妮弗 - 马丁 别走这条路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jennifer. - Marty, don't go this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:57.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特里克兰正在找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strickland's looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你被逮着 就是4次迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get caught, it'll be four tardies in a row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on. I think we're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 这次不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this time it wasn't my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是博士把钟调慢了25分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doc set all his clocks 25 minutes slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在跟 埃米特·布朗博士混呢 对吗 麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I to understand you're still hanging around with Dr. Emmett Brown, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一张迟到通知单给你 帕克小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tardy slip for you, Miss Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:21.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一张给你 麦佛莱 共4次迟到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one for you, McFly. I believe that makes four in a row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:24.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你个免费的忠告 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me give you a nickel's worth of free advice, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个所谓的布朗博士 是危险人物 一个真正的疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This so-called Dr. Brown is dangerous. He's a real nutcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:30.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和他在一起 你会惹上大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hang around with him, you're gonna end up in big trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:31.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:36.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的态度有问题 麦佛莱! 你是个懒散的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a real attitude problem, McFly. You're a slacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:38.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当年他在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remind me of your father when he went here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:40.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是个懒散的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a slacker, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在可以走了吗 斯特里克兰先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I go now, Mr. Strickland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你的乐队在放学后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed your band is on the roster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要参加舞会演奏测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the dance auditions after school today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:49.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何要参加 麦佛莱? 你门都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why even bother, McFly? You don't have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你太像你老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too much like your old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:53.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱一族 从来没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No McFly ever amounted to anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在山谷镇的历史里留名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the history of Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 历史就要改变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, history is gonna change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:02.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大伙 准备摇滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, let's rock 'n roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(舞会演奏测试)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:13.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是针头乐队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the... We're the Pinheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:42.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 谢谢 谢谢你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's enough. Thank you, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:44.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕你们的声音太大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you're just too darn loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是下一个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up the next group, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:59.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,竞选连任的戈尔迪·威尔逊市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Re-elect Mayor "Goldie" Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:01.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他代表着进步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Progress is his middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Too loud." I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:06.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 不给我们机会在人们面前演奏?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never gonna get a chance to play in front of anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 被拒绝一次 并不是世界末日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, one rejection isn't the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 也许我该放弃音乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't think I'm cut out for music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可你很棒 马丁 真的很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're good, Marty. You're really good,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你的试听带也相当不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this audition tape of yours is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该把它寄给唱片公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gotta send it in to the record company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:19.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就像博士说的那样 - 我知道 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's like Doc's always saying. - Yeah, I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:20.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"只要你一心一意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If you put your mind to it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做什么都成"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can accomplish anything."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个很好的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good advice, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧 詹尼弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, okay, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我寄出的带子他们不喜欢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I send in the tape and they don't like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们说我很糟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they say I'm no good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们说: 从这里滚出去 小鬼! 没前途!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they say, "Get out of here, kid. You got no future"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:36.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 我不知道 是否受得了这样的拒绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I just don't think I can take that kind of rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我像极了我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, I'm starting to sound like my old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 得了 他还不算太遭 - 救救钟楼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. He's not that bad. - Save the clock tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:43.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他给你买了辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least he's letting you borrow the car tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看 四轮驱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out that 4x4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Back her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:53.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天 詹尼弗 总有一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday, Jennifer. Someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:57.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开着这车到湖边 不是很棒吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't it be great to take that truck up to the lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:10:01.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钻进车后的睡袋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw a couple of sleeping bags in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:04.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着繁星在上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie out underneath the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:06.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停下 - 怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈知道吗 明晚的事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does your mom know? About tomorrow night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出镇的事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, get out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还以为我是和那帮朋友露营{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom thinks I'm going camping with the guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹尼弗 如果她知道我和你在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer, my mother would freak out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:16.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她会疯掉的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if she knew I was going up there with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她总是一本正经的说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd get the standard lecture about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她当年从没做过这种无聊的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how she never did that kind of stuff when she was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:24.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 她生来就是个修女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look, I think the woman was born a nun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:27.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为她只是想 让你保持举止端正{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just trying to keep you respectable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 那么她做得并不成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she's not doing a very good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是糟透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:34.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救救钟楼! 救救钟楼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save the clock tower. Save the clock tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔逊市长提出议案 欲更换那个钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayor Wilson is sponsoring an initiative to replace that clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,30年前 闪电击中钟楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty years ago, lightning struck that clock tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:43.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从此钟楼停摆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the clock hasn't run since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:45.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们山谷镇文物保护协会认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We at the Hill Valley Preservation Society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:48.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该完整的保留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think it should be preserved exactly the way it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是我们历史和传统的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as part of our history and heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:50.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你 女士 25美分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, lady. There's a quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了拿份传单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to take a flyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:56.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救救钟楼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save the clock tower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说到哪了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就说到这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹尼弗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:07.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我爸爸 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my dad. I've got to go. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚给你电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去祖母家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be at my grandma's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你电话号码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, let me give you the number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:27.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(我爱你!)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:51.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(里昂住宅区)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:05.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,BTD 6-2-9{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo, Tango, Delta 6-2-9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,需要拖车 收到的单位快回复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tow for impoundment. Any unit, please respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. Just perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:22.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不能相信你竟然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you'd loan me your car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,借给我一辆有问题的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without telling me it had a blind spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想要我被撞死吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blind spot? I could've been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Biff, now, I never noticed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,此前我开车的时候 从没见到有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the car had any blind spot before when I would drive it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:36.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞎了眼了 麦佛莱? 就在那儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you blind, McFly? It's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:38.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面那堆废铁你怎么解释?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else do you explain that wreck out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:41.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 我能说个请求吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff, can I assume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该拿...你的保险金 来赔偿车子的损坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your insurance is going to pay for the damage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的保险金? 这可是你的车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My insurance? It's your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己赔去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your insurance should pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想知道谁来赔偿这个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know who's going to pay for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出事时 车子把酒洒我到衣服上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spilled beer all over it when the car smashed into me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来付我的清洗帐单呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna pay my cleaning bill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的报告在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where's my reports?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没做完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I haven't finished those up yet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道 我正在做...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I figured since they weren't due till...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 喂 有人在家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello? Anybody home? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想一想! 麦佛莱! 想一想!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think, McFly. Think! All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还得花时间重新打字呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to have time to get them retyped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我直接将你的手写报告交上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you realize what would happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:13.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道会发生什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I hand in my reports in your handwriting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会被开除的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想让这样的事情发生吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't want that to happen, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吧? - 当然 贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you? - Of course not, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:22.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望这样的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I wouldn't want that to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚就完成报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, look. I'll finish those reports on up tonight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:27.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天一大早就给你送去 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll run them on over first thing tomorrow, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别太早了 星期六我睡懒觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too early. I sleep in Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:31.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看 你鞋带松了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFly, your shoe's untied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:34.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别犯傻了 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be so gullible, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把撞坏的地方修好 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got the place fixed up nice, though, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我大老远把车给你拖来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have your car towed all the way to your house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:42.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就给我喝这么淡的酒吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all you got for me is lite beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看什么看 呆小子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,代我向你妈问好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hi to your mom for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你要说什么 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're going to say, Son,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是对的 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're right. You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但贝夫是我的主管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Biff just happens to be my supervisor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我我不善应对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm afraid I'm just not very good at confrontations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这车子 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the car, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我意思是 他弄坏了车 就得为此负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he wrecked it. He totaled it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常需要这车 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed that car tomorrow night, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:27.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这车对我有多重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how important this was to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any clue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:31.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 但我只能说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, and all I can say is, I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.62,0:14:33.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, Marty, you're better off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:38.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别为这些事情头疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without having to worry about all the aggravation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:42.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伤脑筋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and headaches of playing at that dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:43.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的很对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's absolutely right, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:46.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别为那些事伤脑筋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last thing you need is headaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们 这蛋糕我们得自己吃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, we're going to have to eat this cake by ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊叔叔的假释又没通过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Uncle Joey didn't make parole again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎乔伊叔叔回来!)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:06.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好给他写封信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it would be nice if you all dropped him a line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个"囚鸟叔叔"乔伊吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle "Jailbird" Joey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:09.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他到底是不是你弟弟呀 妈妈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your brother, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个蹲监狱的叔叔 真是奇耻大辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I think it's a major embarrassment, having an uncle in prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一生中都会犯错 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all make mistakes in life, children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 我要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it. I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 管好你的嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, watch your mouth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到这来 走之前亲亲你的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come here and kiss your mother before you go. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:25.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 快点 我要错过巴士了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mom. Make it fast. I'll miss my bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later, Pop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:30.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该换发油了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to change that oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:37.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 马丁 我可不是你的电话答复员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Marty. I'm not your answering service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你在外头 为车子伤脑筋那阵子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you were outside pouting over the car,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗·帕克给你打了两次电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer Parker called you twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢她 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like her, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:46.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话给男孩的女孩只会惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any girl who calls up a boy is just asking for trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:49.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 女孩打电话给男孩没什么错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mother, there's nothing wrong with calling a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:53.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为这糟透了 女孩追男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's terrible. Girls chasing boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在你这年纪 从没追过男孩 打电话给男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was your age, I never chased a boy or called a boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和男孩坐在车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or sat in a parked car with a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:03.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 那我怎么找对象啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how am I supposed to ever meet anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:06.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会遇到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it'll just happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我遇见你们的父亲一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the way I met your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:11.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样太傻了 是外公的车子撞到了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was so stupid. Grandpa hit him with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:13.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是命中注定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:18.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果外公没撞倒他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, if Grandpa hadn't hit him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就不会有你们几个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then none of you would have been born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不知道 那时老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't understand what Dad was doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:25.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在路中间干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:27.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那时在干什么 乔治? 看鸟吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it, George? Bird-watching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 洛莲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, Lorraine? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:33.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 你们外公的车把他撞倒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, your Grandpa hit him with the car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:35.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带到房里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and brought him into the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来是那样的无助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seemed so helpless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:44.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像一只迷路的小狗 我的心就这样被他带走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a little lost puppy, and my heart just went out to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 这故事你讲了无数次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Mom, we know. You've told us this story a million times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得很对不起他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You felt sorry for him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:50.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,于是你决定和他一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you decided to go with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去那个"海里之鱼舞会"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Fish Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:55.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是"海中魅力舞会"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It was the Enchantment Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.09,0:16:59.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的第一次约会 我永生不忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our first date. I'll never forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在暴风雨的那个晚上 还记得吗 乔治?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the night of that terrible thunderstorm, remember, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:09.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们父亲在舞池里第一次吻了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father kissed me for the very first time on that dance floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那一刻我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was then that I realized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:16.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我余下的生命时光 将要和他一同度过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I was going to spend the rest of my life with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你没睡着吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you didn't fall asleep, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:53.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 博士 没有 别傻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, don't be silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 这很重要 我忘了拿摄像机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, this is very important. I forgot my video camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:59.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能否在来购物超市之前 到我那去拿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you stop by my place and pick it up on your way to the mall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以 我这就去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:12.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(双松购物超市)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(布朗博士公司)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦 博士在那里呢? 你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein! Hey, Einstein, where's the doc, boy? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:25.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你终于来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! You made it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:31.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到我的最新试验 这是个大试验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to my latest experiment. This is the big one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一生的时间都在等待它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one I've been waiting for all my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:34.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a DeLorean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稍安勿躁 你会知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bear with me, Marty. All your questions will be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装上磁带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll tape and we'll proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:39.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:40.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就这样穿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that a DEVO suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了 不管了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:42.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:46.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 我是 埃米特·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening. I'm Dr. Emmett Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:48.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正站在双松购物超市停车场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm standing on the parking lot at Twin Pines Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:52.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是1985年10月26日 凌晨1点18分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Saturday morning, October 26, 1985, 1:18 a.m.,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:54.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是1号临时试验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this is temporal experiment number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:56.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 爱因斯坦 到那儿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Einie. Hey, hey, boy, get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:59.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子 坐好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That a boy! In you go. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:01.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,系好安全带 就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your seat belt on. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:09.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请注意爱因斯坦的钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please note that Einstein's clock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:16.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间和我的完全同步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is in precise synchronization with my control watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it? Right. Check, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:18.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:24.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,旅途愉快 爱因斯坦 小心你的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a good trip, Einstein. Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西能遥控车子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that thing hooked up to the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:33.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,注意看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:35.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Okay. Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:40.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:47.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别拍我! 拍车子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me! The car! The car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我计算正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my calculations are correct,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:10.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时速达到88英里时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when this baby hits 88 miles per hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会有惊人的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to see some serious shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看好了 看好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么跟你说的了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:14.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时速88英里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}88 miles per hour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,车子消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The temporal displacement occurred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:22.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正好是在 1:20 零秒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exactly 1:20 a.m. And zero seconds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 博士 你把爱因斯坦分解了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, Doc! You disintegrated Einstein!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,镇定 马丁 我可没分解任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, Marty. I didn't disintegrate anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:36.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在车里完好如初{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The molecular structure of both Einstein and the car are completely intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:37.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可它们到底在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then where the hell are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恰当的问法是:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The appropriate question is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.31,0:22:40.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"它们到底在什么时间?"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"When the hell are they?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:45.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 爱因斯坦成为了世界上第一个时间旅行者!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Einstein has just become the world's first time traveler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把它送到了未来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent him into the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:51.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正好是未来的1分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute into the future, to be exact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当正好到1:21 零秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At precisely 1:21 a.m. And zero seconds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:58.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就会在那时间机器里找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall catch up with him and the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:03.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Wait a minute, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:08.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你是说 你把一台时间机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me that you built a time machine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:10.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装在了那高级跑车里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of a DeLorean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:11.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I see it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然要把时间机器造在车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you're going to build a time machine into a car,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:15.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何不摩登一些呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why not do it with some style?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:18.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且这样的结构很有帮助...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, the stainless-steel construction made the flux dispersal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:21.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:07.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了? 很烫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Is it hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.03,0:24:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很冷 冷极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold. Damn cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:15.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦! 小家伙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein, you little devil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:19.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦的表 正好比我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein's clock is exactly one minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.75,0:24:22.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢了1分钟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind mine and still ticking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.83,0:24:26.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它没事? - 它好得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's all right. - He's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:29.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它什么都不会感觉到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's completely unaware that anything happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:31.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对它而言这是瞬间完成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as he's concerned, the trip was instantaneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么它的钟比我的慢1分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why his watch is exactly one minute behind mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它完全跳过了那一分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He skipped over that minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.89,0:24:37.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞬间到达现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to instantly arrive at this moment in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.85,0:24:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 让你看看如何操作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. I'll show you how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.77,0:24:40.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:45.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 把时间电路打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you turn the time circuits on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:50.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个显示"将来"要去的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This readout tells you where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:51.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个显示"现在"所在的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one tells you where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:53.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个显示"原来"所在的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one tells you where you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用这个键盘输入你的目标时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You input your destination time on this keypad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.07,0:24:57.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比如 你想去见证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say you want to see the signing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:59.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,独立宣言的签署{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Declaration of Independence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.75,0:25:04.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者去看看耶稣的诞生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or witness the birth of Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是这个 科学的重要历史时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a red-letter date in the history of science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.55,0:25:12.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1955年11月5日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}November 5th, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:20.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 当然 1955年11月5日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course. November 5th, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.31,0:25:22.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那天发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I don't get it. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我发明时间旅行的日子 我记得很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the day I invented time travel. I remember it vividly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.61,0:25:30.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那天我正站在马桶上要挂钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was standing on the edge of my toilet, hanging a clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.73,0:25:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地板很湿 我滑倒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The porcelain was wet. I slipped,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.14,0:25:33.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脑袋撞在水池边上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hit my head on the edge of the sink,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当舒醒的时候 我看到了启示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when I came to, I had a revelation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:39.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个幻影 一张图片 呈现于我脑中 就是这个东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a vision, a picture in my head, a picture of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.83,0:25:44.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它 使时间旅行成为可能 通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what makes time travel possible. The flux capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:46.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么电容器?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flux capacitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.42,0:25:48.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我耗费了30年时间 用尽所有家产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's taken me almost 30 years and my entire family fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去实现那天的幻影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to realize the vision of that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:53.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 多么长的时间啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, has it been that long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:57.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里一切都变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things have certainly changed around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:26:00.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得当时这里是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember when this was all farmland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:02.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一望无际的农田{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as far as the eye could see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:05.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是一个皮博迪的老头的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old man Peabody owned all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:10.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他有个疯狂的念头 繁殖松树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had this crazy idea about breeding pine trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.94,0:26:18.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是个...重要的日子 博士 棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is heavy-duty, Doc. This is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它用的是普通的无铅汽油吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it run on regular unleaded gasoline?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.49,0:26:23.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸 不是 它需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, no. It requires something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:25.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更大的功力 它用钚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a little more kick. Plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.75,0:26:27.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钚? 等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plutonium. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.71,0:26:30.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 这东西是核能驱动的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me that this sucker is nuclear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.17,0:26:32.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 嘿! 继续拍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey! Keep rolling. Keep rolling there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.25,0:26:34.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不! 它用电驱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, this sucker's electrical,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:35.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但只有核反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I need a nuclear reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:37.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才能产生所需的1.21兆瓦电能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to generate the 1.21 gigawatts of electricity I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.01,0:26:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你不可能在商店里买到钚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you don't just walk into a store and buy plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:43.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你偷来的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you rip that off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.98,0:26:48.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是 我从利比亚民族分子那里弄到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. From a group of Libyan nationalists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:49.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要我造炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanted me to build them a bomb,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.98,0:26:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿走了他们的钚 留下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I took their plutonium and, in turn, gave them a shoddy bomb casing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.52,0:26:54.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玩具零件做的假弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}full of used pinball machine parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:56.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 过来 准备添加钚燃料... - 天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Let's get you a radiation suit. - Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:57.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备加料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must prepare to reload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.89,0:27:29.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在安全了 脱下面罩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's safe now. Everything's lead-lined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:33.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别把录像带弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you lose those tapes now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.48,0:27:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need that as a record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:37.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放在这里 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put this back here. There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:41.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忘了拿行李{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost forgot my luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:44.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道未来有没有棉衣?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows if they've got cotton underwear in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对合成材料过敏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm allergic to all synthetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.29,0:27:47.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你要去哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,25年后的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, 25 years into the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:54.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直梦想看到人类未来 开开眼界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always dreamed of seeing the future, looking beyond my years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看人类的进步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seeing the progress of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:27:57.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.05,0:28:01.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能看到25年后 世界球赛的获胜队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll also be able to see who wins the next 25 World Series.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:03.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.43,0:28:04.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:07.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到那之后 别忘了看看我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look me up when you get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.77,0:28:10.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会的 录像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed, I will. Roll 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:19.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我 埃米特·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, Dr. Emmett Brown,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:23.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将开始一次历史性的旅行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}am about to embark on an historic journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.49,0:28:27.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I thinking of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:29.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点忘了带额外的钚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost forgot to bring extra plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.70,0:28:32.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可怎么回来啊? 一份钚 一次旅行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I ever expect to get back? One pellet, one trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.33,0:28:33.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定是昏了头了 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must be out of my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:38.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 宝贝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Einie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:48.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:51.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们找到我了! 真不知他们是怎么找到我的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found me. I don't know how, but they found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:52.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run for it, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.73,0:28:53.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁? 谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:56.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为是谁? 是那些利比亚人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think? The Libyans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:01.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:07.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来还击!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll draw their fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.29,0:29:16.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.93,0:29:32.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.23,0:29:34.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:56.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追! 俄罗斯的垃圾枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Damn Soviet gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:02.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:45.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀! 快呀! 见鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Move, damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真要命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.32,0:31:13.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看你能不能加速到90英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if you bastards can do 90.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:07.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么 保罗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What is it, Pa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:11.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像是飞机 但怎么没翅膀?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like an airplane without wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:14.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 它不是飞机 你看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't no airplane. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.39,0:32:18.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(太空传奇  来自冥王星的僵尸)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.66,0:32:36.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.99,0:32:38.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen... Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.01,0:32:52.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.34,0:32:56.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.14,0:33:01.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉弄坏了谷仓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about your barn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:08.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它变成人样了! 快开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's already mutated into human form! Shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.36,0:33:12.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开! 你这个外星杂种!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that, you mutated son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:18.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.33,0:33:20.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot it, Pa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.79,0:33:27.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杂种! ..."皮博迪"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pine! Why you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外星杂种 你弄死了我的松树!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You space bastard! You killed our pine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:35.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(双松种植场)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 麦佛莱 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right. Okay, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.72,0:33:41.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒 这只是场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a grip on yourself. It's all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.93,0:33:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一场非常刺激的梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a very intense dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.75,0:34:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(里昂住宅区)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.86,0:34:21.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎入住 里昂住宅区)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:29.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你们得帮帮我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you got to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:31.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别停下! 他会杀了我们的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stop, Wilbur! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.65,0:34:34.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.07,0:34:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.83,0:34:48.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快发动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.12,0:34:50.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.80,0:34:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(钚燃料箱: 空)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.73,0:35:20.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(山谷镇  2英里)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:45.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到 山谷镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.82,0:36:49.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了 前途就在你们手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, fellow citizens, the future is in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.45,0:36:53.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想要进步 请投 托马斯 一票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you believe in progress, re-elect Mayor Red Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.33,0:36:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他代表着进步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Progress is his middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.46,0:36:58.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雷德·托马斯 市长的政见就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayor Red Thomas' progress platform{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.13,0:37:00.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更多的工作 更好的教育{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}means more jobs, better education,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.76,0:37:03.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更多人权 更少税收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bigger civic improvements and lower taxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:07.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,选举之日 投票给众望所归的领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On election day, cast your vote for a proven leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:10.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雷德·托马斯 连任市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Re-elect Mayor Red Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:12.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(1955年11月5日)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:15.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这准是场梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has got to be a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.77,0:37:19.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(公用电话)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.37,0:37:35.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻人 你干什么了? 刚跳船吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid. What'd you do? Jump ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.37,0:37:36.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.46,0:37:38.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么穿着救生衣?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the life preserver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.09,0:37:45.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要用电话机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to use the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.47,0:37:46.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.60,0:37:50.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃米特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:54.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你 没错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快接电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:17.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道河滨路 1640号在哪里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where 1640 Riverside...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.42,0:38:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要点什么 年轻人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to order something, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.67,0:38:24.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一杯"啤酒"(现代俚语){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Give me a Tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.88,0:38:27.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水龙头(与"啤酒"同音)? 那可不行 你要些别的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tab? I can't give you a tab unless you order something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.38,0:38:29.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我杯"百事"可乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Give me a Pepsi Free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.55,0:38:32.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想要付帐单(与"百事"同音) 你得先要些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a Pepsi, pal, you're going to pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.39,0:38:35.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就给我些不加糖的饮料好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me something without any sugar in it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.68,0:38:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不加糖的饮料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something without sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.07,0:38:46.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.95,0:38:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你在干什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.53,0:38:52.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在和你说话呢 你这个爱尔兰臭虫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking to you, McFly, you Irish bug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 贝夫! 伙计们 你们怎么在这儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Biff. Hey, guys. How are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.71,0:38:59.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的作业做完了吗? 麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got my homework finished, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:02.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 实际上我忘了 星期一才交 所以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, actually, I figured since it wasn't due till Monday...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.88,0:39:05.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂? 喂? 有人在家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello? Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.26,0:39:08.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想一想! 麦佛莱! 想一想!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think, McFly. Think! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.22,0:39:10.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还得花时间抄呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to have time to recopy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.18,0:39:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我交上有你笔迹的作业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You realize what would happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.43,0:39:13.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道会发生什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I hand in my homework in your handwriting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会被踢出学校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get kicked out of school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:18.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想让这样的事情发生吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't want that to happen, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.15,0:39:21.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.27,0:39:22.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, of course not, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:24.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望这样的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I wouldn't want that to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.40,0:39:25.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看什么看 呆小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.03,0:39:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看那 贝夫! 他穿着救生衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff, get a load of this guy's life preserver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.45,0:39:30.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他以为会被淹死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dork thinks he's going to drown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.24,0:39:32.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的作业怎么办 麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about my homework, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.24,0:39:36.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 贝夫 我今晚就完成报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Biff. Well, I'll finish that on up tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.62,0:39:39.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天一大早就给你送去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then I'll bring it over first thing tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.00,0:39:41.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别太早 星期天我睡懒觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too early. I sleep in Sundays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.62,0:39:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱 你鞋带松了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, McFly, your shoe's untied!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.13,0:39:46.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别犯傻了 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be so gullible, McFly. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.25,0:39:47.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想在这再看到你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to see you in here again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:50.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. All right. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.95,0:40:12.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.03,0:40:14.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是 乔治·麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.87,0:40:16.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.33,0:40:17.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懒散的家伙 你怎么能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say! Why do you let those boys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.04,0:40:19.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们这样耍你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}push you around like that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.62,0:40:20.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们块头比我大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're bigger than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.00,0:40:23.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要有骨气 你得自重些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand tall, boy. Have some respect for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.71,0:40:25.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道 他们现在这样利用你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know, if you let people walk over you now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:28.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后会利用你一辈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll be walking over you for the rest of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.17,0:40:29.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我 你以为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. You think I'm gonna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.67,0:40:31.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在这个小店里呆一辈子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spend the rest of my life in this slop house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:33.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说话小心点 - 不 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch it, Goldie. - No, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.30,0:40:34.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要干大事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna make something of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.59,0:40:35.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在上夜校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to night school,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天我要当上大人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one day, I'm going to be somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.18,0:40:40.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 他会当上市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. He's going to be mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.14,0:40:41.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.19,0:40:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,市长?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.31,0:40:48.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个好主意 我可以竞选市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's a good idea! I could run for mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.32,0:40:49.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑人市长? 真是个奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A colored mayor. That'll be the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.90,0:40:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你等着 我会当上市长的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait and see, Mr. Caruthers. I will be mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.32,0:40:54.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要成为山谷镇最有势力的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be the most powerful man in Hill Valley,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.70,0:40:56.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好清理这个镇子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm going to clean up this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.57,0:40:59.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 你先从清理地板开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. You can start by sweeping the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.08,0:41:06.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔逊市长 我喜欢听到这句话!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayor Goldie Wilson. I like the sound of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.01,0:41:16.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:22.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸...乔治 你还有自行车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad! George! Hey, you on the bike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.42,0:41:55.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个偷窥狂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a peeping Tom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:02.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.24,0:42:17.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait a minute. Wait a minute. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.03,0:42:21.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔拉! 我的车又撞倒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stella! Another one of these damn kids{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.95,0:42:23.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个呆小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}jumped in front of my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.33,0:42:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来帮忙把他抬到房子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on out here! Help me take him in the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.55,0:42:35.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom? That you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.05,0:42:39.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了 放松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there, now. Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.72,0:42:44.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你几乎睡了9个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been asleep for almost nine hours now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:49.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是场恶梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a horrible nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.10,0:42:54.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还好及时回来了 真可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dreamed that I went back in time. It was terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:43:01.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回到美好的1955年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're safe and sound now, back in good old 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.20,0:43:03.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1955年?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1955?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.41,0:43:11.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我妈妈 你是我妈妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my... You're my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.29,0:43:12.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我名叫洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.92,0:43:15.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲·贝恩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine Baines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.17,0:43:16.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.38,0:43:20.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你..你真是太...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're... You're so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.59,0:43:23.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太苗条了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so thin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.01,0:43:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松 卡尔文 你的头撞伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just relax, Calvin. You got a big bruise on your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.56,0:43:33.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我裤子呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are my pants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.65,0:43:36.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那 在我的衣箱上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there, on my hope chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:41.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没见过紫色的内裤 卡尔文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen purple underwear before, Calvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.03,0:43:44.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔文? 为什么你一直叫我卡尔文?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calvin? Why do you keep calling me Calvin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的名字吗? 卡尔文·克雷恩?(内裤品牌名){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that is your name, isn't it? Calvin Klein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.37,0:43:51.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你内裤上写得到处都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's written all over your underwear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.42,0:43:53.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家是不是叫你 卡尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I guess they call you Cal, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.17,0:43:57.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 实际上 大家叫我马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, actually, people call me Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.97,0:44:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你 卡尔文...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleased to meet you, Calvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.30,0:44:04.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.10,0:44:07.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克雷恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.11,0:44:16.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你介意我坐在这吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I sit here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:17.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.53,0:44:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 很好 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Good. Fine. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.90,0:44:24.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的伤口不小呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a big bruise you have there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.83,0:44:28.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲 亲爱的你还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine, are you up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.24,0:44:30.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝 我妈妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! It's my mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:33.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快穿上你的牛仔裤!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Put your pants back on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.55,0:44:44.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你来这多久了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, tell me, Marty, how long have you been in port?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.43,0:44:45.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.51,0:44:46.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看你穿着救生衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guessed you're a sailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.60,0:44:48.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准是个水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you wear that life preserver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.85,0:44:50.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是海岸防卫队吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coast Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.43,0:44:52.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 他就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, here's the young man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.44,0:44:53.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你撞到的那个年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you hit with your car out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.94,0:44:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很好 感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all right. Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:57.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这年纪在路中间干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you doing in the middle of the street, a kid your age?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别太在意 他心情不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't pay attention to him. He's in one of his moods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.40,0:45:00.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 别弄那东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, you quit fiddling with that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.07,0:45:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in here to dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.57,0:45:04.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来介绍 你已见过洛莲了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's see. You already know Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.66,0:45:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是内利森 这是萨利 那是托比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Milton, this is Sally, that's Toby,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在娃娃床里的是乔伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and over there in the playpen is little baby Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.46,0:45:15.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你就是我的乔伊舅舅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're my uncle Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.33,0:45:18.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这铁窗你最好习惯点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better get used to these bars, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:22.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀! 乔伊就是喜欢呆在娃娃床里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Joey just loves being in his playpen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:24.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要把他带出来他就哭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He cries whenever we take him out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们整天都把他放在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we just leave him in there all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.89,0:45:29.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 但愿你喜欢吃肉丸子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Marty, I hope you like meatloaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.18,0:45:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 我只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I really ought to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.47,0:45:32.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐这 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit here, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.27,0:45:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 别弄那东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, stop fiddling with that thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.23,0:45:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and come in here and eat your dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.48,0:45:41.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看那! 可以用了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.32,0:45:43.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一边吃饭一边看电视了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we can watch Jackie Gleason while we eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.33,0:45:54.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们家的第一台电视机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our first television set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.21,0:45:55.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸今天挑的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad just picked it up today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.71,0:45:58.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有电视机吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a television?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.88,0:46:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我们家有两台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah. You know we have two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.84,0:46:04.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很有钱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! You must be rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:06.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 他是逗你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, honey, he's teasing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.34,0:46:08.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人有两台电视机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody has two television sets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.85,0:46:16.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个我看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey, I've seen this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.23,0:46:17.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过! 这是个老家节目了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen this one! This is a classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.73,0:46:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人穿得像个太空人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where Ralph dresses up as a man from space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:24.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"看过"是什么意思? 这可是最新的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, you've seen this? It's brand-new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.61,0:46:26.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经看过...它的重播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I saw it on a rerun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.70,0:46:29.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是"重播"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a rerun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.57,0:46:30.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.20,0:46:35.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 马丁 你看起来很面熟 我认识你的母亲吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Marty, you look so familiar to me. Do I know your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.79,0:46:38.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我想你认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think maybe you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:40.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我想给她打个电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, then I want to give her a call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:42.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让她担心你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want her to worry about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:43.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在家里没人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is, nobody's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.64,0:46:51.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.02,0:46:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道河滨路在哪吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, do you know where Riverside Drive is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.98,0:46:59.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在小镇另一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the other end of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:02.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梅伯路的后面 小镇的东边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A block past Maple. East end of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.19,0:47:04.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 梅伯路后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, a block past Maple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.15,0:47:06.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是约翰·肯尼迪路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's John F. Kennedy Drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.03,0:47:09.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是约翰·肯尼迪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is John F. Kennedy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.11,0:47:10.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.03,0:47:13.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许马丁的父母出镇去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Marty's parents out of town,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.20,0:47:16.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不认为该留他过夜吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't you think he ought to spend the night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.70,0:47:19.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟 爸爸差点把他撞死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, after all, Dad almost killed him with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.33,0:47:21.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.38,0:47:23.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该留下来过夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think maybe you should spend the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.09,0:47:24.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're our responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.71,0:47:26.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不必了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.42,0:47:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以睡在我的房间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he can sleep in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:30.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go! I gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.93,0:47:32.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们 晚餐很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks very much. It was wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们人也不错 以后见 不会等太久的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were all great. See you all later. Much later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.23,0:47:44.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个奇怪的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a very strange young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.11,0:47:45.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,家庭教养有问题 他父母一定也是白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comes from upbringing. His parents are probably idiots, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.65,0:47:50.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲 如果你有这样的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine, you ever have a kid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.95,0:47:53.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就和你断绝关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who acts that way, I'll disown you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.32,0:48:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.32,0:48:34.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想知道你的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.33,0:48:38.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想知道你的任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to know anything about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.58,0:48:40.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 听着 博士 - 别说话!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen, Doc... - Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.41,0:48:41.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 博士 是我 马丁 - 什么也别说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doc, it's me, Marty. - Don't tell me anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:44.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 博士 你要帮我... - 别说话! 别说话!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doc, you got to help... - Quiet. Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.92,0:48:48.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要读出你的思想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to read your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.01,0:48:52.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从很远的地方来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see now. You've come here from a great distance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.68,0:48:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.88,0:48:55.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:57.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我订{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to buy a subscription{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.18,0:48:58.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,周六晚报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Saturday Evening Post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:48:59.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.72,0:49:01.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说话! 别说话!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a word. Not a word now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.27,0:49:02.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是捐款 你要我捐款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donations. You want me to make a donation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.27,0:49:10.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给海岸防卫队的补给舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Coast Guard Youth Auxiliary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.11,0:49:12.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.03,0:49:15.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来自未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.24,0:49:19.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我乘坐你发明的时间机器来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here in a time machine that you invented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.74,0:49:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮助我回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I need your help to get back to the year 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.92,0:49:34.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这意味着什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what this means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:40.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着这狗东西 一点用也没有!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that this damn thing doesn't work at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.22,0:49:42.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得帮助我 你是唯一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you got to help me. You are the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.22,0:49:44.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道时间机器如何工作的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who knows how your time machine works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.64,0:49:48.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间机器 我可没发明过什么时间机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time machine? I haven't invented any time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.40,0:49:52.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. All right, I'll prove it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.90,0:49:56.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的驾照 1987年到期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my driver's license. Expires 1987.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.16,0:49:57.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看我的生日 会令你大吃一惊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my birthday, for crying out loud!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.74,0:49:59.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没出生呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't even been born yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.83,0:50:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And look at this picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.24,0:50:04.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥 我姐姐 还有我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my brother, my sister and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.33,0:50:07.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看运动衫 1984年的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at her sweatshirt, Doc. "Class of 1984"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:10.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这照片真糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty mediocre photographic fakery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.67,0:50:12.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥的脑袋被截去了一半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cut off your brother's hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.46,0:50:15.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是实话 博士 你得相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling the truth, Doc. You got to believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.93,0:50:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那告诉我 你这未来小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then tell me, future boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.18,0:50:22.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1985年美国总统是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's President of the United States in 1985?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.35,0:50:24.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛伦·里根(曾经当过演员){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ronald Reagan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.48,0:50:26.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛伦·里根 那个三流演员?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ronald Reagan? The actor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.44,0:50:30.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那副总统是谁? 杰瑞·李维斯吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then who's vice president? Jerry Lewis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.15,0:50:34.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮·怀曼 是第一夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose Jane Wyman is the First Lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.61,0:50:35.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. Wait, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.78,0:50:37.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,泰德·克班尼 就是财政部部长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Jack Benny is secretary of the treasury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.07,0:50:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你得听我说!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you gotta listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.57,0:50:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天够忙的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had enough practical jokes for one evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.74,0:50:42.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 祝你好运 未来小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, future boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.99,0:50:44.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait, Doc. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.45,0:50:47.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撞伤 你头部的撞伤 我知道是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bruise on your head, I know how that happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.33,0:50:48.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你全告诉了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me the whole story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.83,0:50:50.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你站在马桶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were standing on your toilet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.38,0:50:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备挂钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you were hanging a clock,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.50,0:50:53.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你滑倒了 撞在水池上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you fell and you hit your head on the sink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.80,0:50:56.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个念头忽现: 通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when you came up with the idea for the flux capacitor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.80,0:51:00.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它 使时间旅行成为可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is what makes time travel possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:18.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它发动不起来 所以我把它藏在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something wrong with the starter, so I hid it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.58,0:51:32.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在厕所摔倒之后 我画了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I fell off my toilet, I drew this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.92,0:51:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The flux capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:57.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:01.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.24,0:52:05.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于发明了能用的东西!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finally invent something that works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.70,0:52:08.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它当然可以用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet your ass it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.75,0:52:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把它偷偷弄回实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow we've got to sneak this back to my laboratory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.88,0:52:14.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们着手把你送回家吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get you home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.46,0:52:17.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 就是这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Doc, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.05,0:52:21.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了 不管了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind that. Never mind that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.22,0:52:24.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看呀! 是我! 我变成老头了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, that's me! Look at me! I'm an old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.72,0:52:25.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 我是 埃米特·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening. I'm Dr. Emmett Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.06,0:52:28.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正站在双松购物超市停车场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm standing on the parking lot at Twin Pines Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.22,0:52:30.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝 我还有头发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God, I've still got my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.31,0:52:32.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿着什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on Earth is this thing I'm wearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.39,0:52:34.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是防辐射衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a radiation suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,防辐射衣?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radiation suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:39.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊! 就跟原子沉落一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. 'Cause of all the fallout from the atomic wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:43.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这 真是了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is truly amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个手提电视摄像机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A portable television studio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.91,0:52:48.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你们的总统是个演员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder your president has to be an actor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.49,0:52:50.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他在电视上好看些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gotta look good on television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.75,0:52:53.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到了 就是这部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. This is it. This is the part coming up, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.92,0:52:55.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这依靠电能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, this sucker's electrical,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.46,0:52:56.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有核反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I need a nuclear reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.59,0:52:58.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才能产生所需的 1.21 兆瓦电能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to generate the 1.21 gigawatts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.46,0:53:00.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.26,0:53:05.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这依靠电能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This sucker's electrical,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.43,0:53:06.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有核反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I need a nuclear reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.64,0:53:08.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才能产生所需的 1.21 兆瓦电能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to generate the 1.21 gigawatts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.43,0:53:10.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1.21 兆瓦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1.21 gigawatts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.27,0:53:14.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1.21 兆瓦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1.21 gigawatts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.48,0:53:18.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.28,0:53:22.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"兆瓦特"是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is a gigawatt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:27.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会如此随便? 1.21 兆瓦是多少啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I have been so careless? 1.21 gigawatts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.66,0:53:30.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么弄到如此巨大的能量?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom, how am I going to generate that kind of power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be done, can it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.16,0:53:35.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 博士 我们只需要一点点钚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, look. All we need is a little plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.13,0:53:37.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 在1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure that in 1985,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.96,0:53:40.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每个药品商店里都能买到钚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}plutonium is available in every corner drugstore,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.21,0:53:42.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但在1955年 就很难弄到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but in 1955, it's a little hard to come by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.05,0:53:46.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我很抱歉 你被困在这了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I'm sorry, but I'm afraid you're stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:52.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能被困在这 我的生活在1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, stuck here? I can't be stuck here. I got a life in 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:53.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有个女朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.39,0:53:54.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她漂亮吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she pretty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.98,0:53:58.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她非常漂亮 非常爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, she's beautiful. She's crazy about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.02,0:54:03.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个 看她在这写的 博士 这说明了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. Look what she wrote here, Doc. I mean, that says it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.57,0:54:07.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你是我的唯一希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you're my only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.82,0:54:11.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 对不起 产生1.21兆瓦电能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I'm sorry, but the only power source capable of generating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.24,0:54:14.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,的唯一方法 只有闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1.21 gigawatts of electricity is a bolt of lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.87,0:54:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.08,0:54:18.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bolt of lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.33,0:54:19.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 你无法知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, you never know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.42,0:54:22.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,何时何地会出现闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when or where it's ever going to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.05,0:54:25.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.51,0:54:34.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它! 这就是答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it! This is the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.85,0:54:37.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里写着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says here that a bolt of lightning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.35,0:54:38.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电在晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to strike the clock tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.44,0:54:41.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,10:04 击中钟楼 就在下周六晚上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at precisely 10:04 p.m. Next Saturday night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.24,0:54:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能设法将闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we could somehow harness this lightning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.87,0:54:53.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,导入通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}channel it into the flux capacitor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.41,0:54:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就能使它运作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it just might work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.50,0:55:00.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下周六晚我们就能送你回到未来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next Saturday night, we're sending you back to the future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.71,0:55:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下周六 好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, all right. Saturday's good. Saturday's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.67,0:55:05.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得在1955年呆上一周了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can spend a week in 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.55,0:55:07.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你带我到处走走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hang out. You can show me around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.38,0:55:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 不行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, that is completely out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.30,0:55:10.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须呆在房子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not leave this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能见任何人 与任何人说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not see anybody or talk to anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.81,0:55:15.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的会对未来有严重影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you do can have serious repercussions on future events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:17.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.10,0:55:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.69,0:55:21.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.31,0:55:25.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除我之外 你今天没碰到别人吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have you interacted with anybody else today, besides me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.57,0:55:30.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我可能碰到了我的父母{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I might've sort of bumped into my parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.78,0:55:32.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.41,0:55:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再看看照片上你的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see that photograph again of your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:41.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正像我说的那样 这验证了我的理论 看你的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as I thought. This proves my theory. Look at your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.75,0:55:45.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊! 他的头像被擦掉了一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His head's gone. It's like it's been erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:49.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,擦掉他的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erased from existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.43,0:55:58.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方扫过之后 就像新的一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They really cleaned this place up. Looks brand-new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.27,0:55:59.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.35,0:56:00.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据我的理论 你干预了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to my theory, you interfered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.69,0:56:01.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父母的初次相遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your parents' first meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.94,0:56:03.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有相遇 他们就不会相爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they don't meet, they won't fall in love,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:05.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就不会结婚 也就没有孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they won't get married and they won't have kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.15,0:56:06.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 你哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why your older brother's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.28,0:56:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从照片上消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}disappearing from that photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.61,0:56:09.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你姐姐是下一个 除非你想办法改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister will follow, and unless you repair the damage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.90,0:56:11.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则下一个就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:14.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 听起来非常"严重"(很重) - "很重"? 重量跟这件事无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sounds pretty heavy. - Weight has nothing to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:16.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个是你父亲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one's your pop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.29,0:56:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.08,0:56:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 好 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.13,0:56:26.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这很有趣 你们真成熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny. You guys are being real mature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.46,0:56:28.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你是被他领养的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you were adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.42,0:56:30.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们真成熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, real mature, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.88,0:56:33.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,捡起我的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, pick up my books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.34,0:56:34.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.47,0:56:36.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 斯特里克兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Strickland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.64,0:56:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 那家伙长过头发没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, didn't that guy ever have hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.81,0:56:41.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个懒散的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shape up, man. You're a slacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算这辈子都这样懒散下去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to be a slacker for the rest of your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.81,0:56:45.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.23,0:56:47.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈怎么会看上这样的家伙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did your mother ever see in that kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.86,0:56:49.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.23,0:56:50.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜我妈妈是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess she felt sorry for him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.03,0:56:53.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为外公撞倒他而感到抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause her dad hit him with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.66,0:56:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可现在车子撞倒的是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.99,0:56:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是 法伦·史戴伦 效应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Florence Nightingale effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.08,0:57:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,医院的护士会爱上病人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happens in hospitals when nurses fall in love with their patients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.50,0:57:02.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to it, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.58,0:57:06.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, George, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.00,0:57:09.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在找你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been looking all over for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.46,0:57:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我吗? 我救了你命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember me, the guy who saved your life the other day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.68,0:57:14.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.76,0:57:16.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你见个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's somebody I'd like you to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.18,0:57:22.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.85,0:57:23.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔文!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calvin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.44,0:57:28.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见见我的好友 乔治·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like you to meet my good friend George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.27,0:57:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. It's really a pleasure to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.69,0:57:33.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头怎样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.82,0:57:35.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.24,0:57:37.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚你离开之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I've been so worried about you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直为你担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever since you ran off the other night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.16,0:57:40.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吗?  - 没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:43.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.21,0:57:44.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走啦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:47.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真是个白马王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't he a dreamboat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.26,0:57:52.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 她对他不屑一顾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, she didn't even look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.92,0:57:54.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is more serious than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.55,0:57:56.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,显然 你母亲迷上了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, your mother is amorously infatuated with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.59,0:57:58.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:57:59.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. Wait a minute, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.06,0:58:03.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我妈妈喜欢上我了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you trying to tell me that my mother has got the hots for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.81,0:58:04.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.02,0:58:06.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢..."严重"了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. This is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.65,0:58:08.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又说那个字眼: "很重"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's that word again. "Heavy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.81,0:58:10.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么每件事都"很重"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are things so heavy in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.23,0:58:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是未来的地心引力出了问题?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem with the Earth's gravitational pull?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.40,0:58:14.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一让他们结婚的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? The only way we're going to get those two to successfully mate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.07,0:58:16.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是让他们独处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is if they're alone together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.53,0:58:19.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们多交流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you've got to get your father and mother to interact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.24,0:58:21.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通过某些社交活动...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in some sort of social...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.66,0:58:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你意思是 一个约会? - 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? You mean like a date? - Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.41,0:58:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么样的约会? - 我可不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What kind of date? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.58,0:58:28.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,50年代的孩子都干些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do kids do in the '50s?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.21,0:58:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是你的父母 你该知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're your parents. You must know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.09,0:58:32.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的共同兴趣是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are their common interests?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.30,0:58:34.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢一起做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they like to do together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.26,0:58:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.43,0:58:39.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看! 有个舞会要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! There's a rhythmic ceremonial ritual coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.72,0:58:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错! 就是"海中魅力舞会"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course! The Enchantment Under the Sea dance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.76,0:58:43.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在那里约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're supposed to go to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.22,0:58:44.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那第一次接吻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where they kiss for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.06,0:58:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.52,0:58:48.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好看着你父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stick to your father like glue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.19,0:58:49.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把他带到舞会上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make sure he takes her to that dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.44,0:58:51.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:56.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我给你介绍的那个女孩吗? 洛莲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that girl I introduced you to, Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.08,0:59:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在写什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:05.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...小说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.62,0:59:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于...天外来客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science fiction stories about visitors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.63,0:59:13.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从另一个行星来到地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming down to Earth from other planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:19.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了 我不知道 你还有这样的想象力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of town! I didn't know you did anything creative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.09,0:59:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看看?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me read some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.30,0:59:22.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.97,0:59:25.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从不让别人看我的小说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never let anybody read my stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.56,0:59:27.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.23,0:59:30.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们不喜欢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what if they didn't like them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.19,0:59:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们说我很糟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they told me I was no good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.73,0:59:37.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这很难让人理解的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that would be pretty hard for somebody to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.99,0:59:41.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不...一点也不难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, not hard at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.78,0:59:45.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 乔治 关于洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, anyway, George. About Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:48.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她很喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She really likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.29,0:59:52.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她要我告诉你 要你邀请她去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me to tell you that she wants you to ask her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.33,0:59:54.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"海中魅力舞会"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Enchantment Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:55.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的? - 是的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.42,0:59:58.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只过去去邀请她就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you got to do is go over there and ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.42,1:00:01.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 就在这餐厅里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Right here, right now, in the cafeteria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.68,1:00:02.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是她不答应呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if she said no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.84,1:00:06.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 是否受得了这样的拒绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I could take that kind of a rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.10,1:00:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我想她宁愿另一个人去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I think she'd rather go with somebody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.35,1:00:13.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.32,1:00:16.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.99,1:00:19.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲热一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kid around. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.29,1:00:20.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.53,1:00:22.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 你喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it. You know you want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.49,1:00:24.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you want me to give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:27.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住嘴! 我才不是那种女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut your filthy mouth. I'm not that kind of girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.54,1:00:31.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是的 只不过你还不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you are and you just don't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.37,1:00:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your meat hooks off of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.29,1:00:34.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.42,1:00:37.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她要你放开她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said, get your meat hooks off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.21,1:00:40.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关你什么事 呆小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's it to you, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.51,1:00:46.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是欠揍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you been looking for a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.69,1:01:00.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看在你是新来的份上 我放过你 只是今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you're new here, I'm going to cut you a break, today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在给我从这里滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why don't you make like a tree and get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.05,1:01:20.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.59,1:01:23.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你老跟着我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you keep following me around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.72,1:01:26.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 乔治! ... 我在和你说话呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, George... I'm telling you, George,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.76,1:01:28.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不邀请洛莲去跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you do not ask Lorraine to that dance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.60,1:01:30.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会后悔一辈子的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna regret it for the rest of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.18,1:01:31.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不能去跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't go to the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.73,1:01:34.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那会错过我最喜欢的电视节目《科幻小说剧场》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll miss my favorite television program, Science Fiction Theatre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.94,1:01:38.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但 乔治...洛莲想要和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but, George, Lorraine wants to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.40,1:01:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给她一次机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give her a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.61,1:01:43.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没打算和洛莲跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm just not ready to ask Lorraine out to the dance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.57,1:01:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你们每个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not you or anybody else on this planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.87,1:01:50.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都想要改变我的意愿呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to make me change my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.25,1:01:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科幻小说剧场?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science Fiction Theatre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.02,1:02:10.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(科幻小说)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.40,1:02:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(前卫音乐)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.83,1:02:31.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.46,1:02:39.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说话 地球人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence, Earthling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我名叫达斯·维达(星球大战人物){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Darth Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.47,1:02:51.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是飞鹰星来的外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an extraterrestrial from the planet Vulcan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.02,1:02:55.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.35,1:02:59.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁! 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.52,1:03:00.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, George, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.69,1:03:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没上学? 这一整天你做什么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't at school. What have you been doing all day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.15,1:03:06.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我睡过头了 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I overslept. Look, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.15,1:03:07.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须邀请洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to ask Lorraine out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:08.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我不知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't know how to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.86,1:03:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 喘口气 她在咖啡店里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Okay, listen, keep your pants on. She's over in the cafe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.78,1:03:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God! How do you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.91,1:03:18.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么改变主意了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What made you change your mind, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.46,1:03:21.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚 从飞鹰星来了个外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night, Darth Vader came down from Planet Vulcan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.46,1:03:25.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉我 如果我不邀请洛莲 他就熔化我的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and told me that if I didn't take Lorraine out, that he'd melt my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.46,1:03:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们保守这个秘密 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just keep this brain-melting stuff to ourselves, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.63,1:03:29.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.84,1:03:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好 她在那 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, okay. There she is, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.22,1:03:33.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进去 邀请她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now just go in there and invite her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.06,1:03:35.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我不知道该说些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. But I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.72,1:03:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么都行 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say anything, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.89,1:03:40.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自然点儿 说你想到的第一句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say whatever's natural, the first thing that comes into your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.56,1:03:43.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我脑子里空空如也{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's coming to my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.57,1:03:45.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 我怎么会出生的啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, George, it's a wonder I was even born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.36,1:03:46.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.40,1:03:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么...没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Nothing. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.49,1:03:52.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比如 跟她说 是命运让你们相遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, tell her destiny brought you together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.66,1:03:54.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是你所见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her that she is the most beautiful girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.66,1:03:56.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最美丽的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have ever seen in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.58,1:03:58.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女孩总喜欢这样的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls like that stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.91,1:03:59.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要记下来 这些话很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm writing this down. This is good stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.88,1:04:03.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.46,1:04:04.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 整整头发 - 我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you take care of that? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.44,1:04:26.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一杯牛奶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lou, give me a milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.73,1:04:29.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加巧克力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chocolate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.29,1:04:50.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲 命运将我带给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine. My density has popped me to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.76,1:04:52.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.05,1:04:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我意思是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I meant to say was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.81,1:05:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 我见过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Don't I know you from somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.31,1:05:02.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.73,1:05:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我是乔治 乔治·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I'm George. George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.27,1:05:08.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的"密度"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your density.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.94,1:05:11.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.65,1:05:14.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.08,1:05:18.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.87,1:05:21.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.91,1:05:25.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你 别到这来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I told you never to come in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.34,1:05:30.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁花你的钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's going to cost you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.92,1:05:33.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你身上有多少钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much money you got on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.51,1:05:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要多少 贝夫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you want, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.85,1:05:45.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 呆子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, punk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:46.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm going to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.61,1:05:48.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, Biff. What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.99,1:05:58.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 卡尔文·克雷恩 噢 我的天 真像梦一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Calvin Klein. Oh, my God, he's a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.33,1:06:01.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid! Kid, stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:02.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.54,1:06:05.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待会还你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get it back to you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.67,1:06:08.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你弄坏了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You broke it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.71,1:06:09.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.01,1:06:13.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. Look at him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.63,1:06:16.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.23,1:06:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快追车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the car! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.70,1:06:39.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在什么东西上面?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that thing he's on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.03,1:06:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一块有轮子的板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a board with wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.58,1:06:43.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真是白马王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an absolute dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.24,1:06:44.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.54,1:06:46.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追上那辆车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out for the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.41,1:07:21.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要宰了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to ram him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:29.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.63,1:07:42.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(肥料车)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.02,1:07:56.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.86,1:08:00.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找那狗娘养的算帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.36,1:08:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从哪来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does he come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.49,1:08:03.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 他住在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, where does he live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.08,1:08:07.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 但我会找出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, but I'm going to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.50,1:08:14.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:18.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么找到我的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found me. I don't know how, but they found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.42,1:08:20.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run for it, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:26.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.97,1:08:29.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么找到我的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found me. I don't know how, but they found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.98,1:08:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run for it, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.65,1:08:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.48,1:08:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 马丁 我没听到你进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Marty. I didn't hear you come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.40,1:08:40.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣的机器...录像机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating device, this video unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.95,1:08:43.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.70,1:08:44.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情要告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there's something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.74,1:08:45.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于那晚...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't told you about the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.03,1:08:47.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们拍的录像 - 马丁 别告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- we made that tape. - Please, Marty, don't tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.41,1:08:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于我命运的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man should know too much about his own destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.79,1:08:50.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不明白 - 我当然明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't understand. - I do understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.25,1:08:51.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对自己的命运知道太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I know too much about my own future,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.54,1:08:52.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不会为生存而努力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can endanger my own existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.04,1:08:55.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你和大自然斗争一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as you've endangered yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.34,1:08:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.34,1:09:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你看看送你回家的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you my plan for sending you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.30,1:09:04.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 这模型有点粗糙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please excuse the crudity of this model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.14,1:09:06.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间做精确比例 上颜色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have time to build it to scale or paint it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.55,1:09:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很不错 - 谢谢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good. - Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.77,1:09:10.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.06,1:09:13.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们使用工业电线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We run some industrial-strength electrical cable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.35,1:09:15.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从钟楼的顶部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the top of the clock tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.27,1:09:16.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,牵到街上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down, suspending it over the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.98,1:09:18.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两灯柱之间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between these two lamp posts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.19,1:09:21.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时 我们把时间机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, we've outfitted the time vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.74,1:09:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这的竿子 和钩子连接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with this big pole and hook,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.28,1:09:26.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直达通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which runs directly into the flux capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.16,1:09:31.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在计算好的时间 你从街头出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the calculated moment, you start off from down the street,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.91,1:09:33.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,驶向电线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}driving directly toward the cable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.25,1:09:36.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加速至时速 88 英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accelerating to 88 miles per hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.50,1:09:39.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据传单上说 本周六晚 10:04{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the flyer, at precisely 10:04 p.m. This Saturday night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.96,1:09:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电将准时击中钟楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lightning will strike the clock tower, electrifying the cable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.68,1:09:45.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电线正好在那时与钩子接触{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just as the connecting hook makes contact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.01,1:09:49.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将 1.21 兆瓦电力导入通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thereby sending 1.21 gigawatts into the flux capacitor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.01,1:09:52.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你送回1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sending you back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.27,1:09:54.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 看好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, now. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把这小车上紧然后放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wind up the car and release it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.11,1:10:00.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我模拟闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll simulate the lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.62,1:10:09.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.54,1:10:20.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:26.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.36,1:10:47.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才不是很有信心吗 博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're instilling me with a lot of confidence, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.61,1:10:48.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 这个我来处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'll take care of the lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.07,1:10:51.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你注意好你的父亲就是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take care of your pop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.83,1:10:55.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 今天进展如何? 他约她出去了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, what happened today? Did he ask her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.91,1:10:57.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.12,1:10:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说什么了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did she say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:08.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你母亲 她找到你了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your mom! She's tracked you down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.68,1:11:10.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把车盖好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Let's cover the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.28,1:11:26.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Cal... Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.24,1:11:28.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈...洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom. Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我在这?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know I was here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.33,1:11:34.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟踪你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的博士...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. This is my doc...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.79,1:11:40.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叔叔 布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My uncle, Doc Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.21,1:11:43.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.55,1:11:49.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我知道这有点早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, this may seem a little forward,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.09,1:11:54.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 你是否会邀请我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was kind of wondering if you'd ask me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.39,1:11:58.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,参加星期六的"魅力海洋舞会"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Enchantment Under the Sea dance on Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.90,1:12:04.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 还没人邀请你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, you mean... You mean nobody's asked you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.77,1:12:07.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.57,1:12:11.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那乔治呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.20,1:12:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治·麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.54,1:12:19.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很可爱 但你知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's kind of cute and all, but not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.42,1:12:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要的是强壮的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think a man should be strong,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.46,1:12:28.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能靠自己站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he can stand up for himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.76,1:12:32.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去保护他心爱的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and protect the woman he loves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.72,1:12:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.60,1:12:40.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.14,1:12:43.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.60,1:12:46.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么和她去跳舞呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I supposed to go to the dance with her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.40,1:12:49.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她不是要和你跳吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if she's already going to the dance with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.24,1:12:51.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 乔治 她想和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, because, George, she wants to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是她自己还不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just doesn't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.99,1:12:54.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我们要让她知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we got to show her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.07,1:12:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你 乔治·麦佛莱 是个勇士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you, George McFly, are a fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.12,1:12:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个能自己站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're somebody who's gonna stand up for yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:00.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并且能保护她的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody who's gonna protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.66,1:13:03.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我这辈子还没打过架呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I've never picked a fight in my entire life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.96,1:13:06.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是去打架 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you're not going to be picking a fight, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.79,1:13:09.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸...老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy-o.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.09,1:13:11.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是去拯救她 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming to her rescue, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.47,1:13:12.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 再重复一次我的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go over the plan again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.72,1:13:14.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,8:55 你去哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}8:55, where are you going to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:16.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to be at the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.22,1:13:17.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我去哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. And where am I going to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.35,1:13:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和她一起呆在车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be in the car with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.43,1:13:20.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 9:00{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, okay. So, right around 9:00,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.98,1:13:22.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她就会对我感到恼火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's going to get very angry with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.48,1:13:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么她会恼火?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is she going to get angry with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.98,1:13:27.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 乔治 当男孩占她们便宜的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, because, George, nice girls get angry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.40,1:13:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好女孩 总是会生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when guys take advantage of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.90,1:13:33.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你意思是 你要碰她...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean you're going to go touch her on her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.99,1:13:36.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, George, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.28,1:13:39.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是表演 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just an act, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.54,1:13:43.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 9:00 你就到停车场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So, 9:00, you're strolling through the parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.46,1:13:46.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会看到车里有争斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see us struggling in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.09,1:13:50.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你走过来 拉开车门 说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk up, you open the door, and you say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.88,1:13:53.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的台词 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your line, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.76,1:13:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你! 把那该死的手从她身上拿开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you, get your damn hands off her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.93,1:14:03.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须诅咒吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think I ought to swear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.35,1:14:04.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 干脆点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.44,1:14:06.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it, George, swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.15,1:14:08.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好! 你走过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So, now you come up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.23,1:14:09.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,揍我的肚子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You punch me in the stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.44,1:14:11.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我逃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out for the count, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.32,1:14:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和洛莲 从此将幸福的生活在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you and Lorraine live happily ever after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.61,1:14:16.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说起来很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make it sound so easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.91,1:14:19.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望不会感到点怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just... I wish I wasn't so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.45,1:14:20.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 没什么好怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, there's nothing to be scared of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.79,1:14:23.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只需要一点自信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it takes is a little self-confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.41,1:14:26.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 "只要一心一意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you put your mind to it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.21,1:14:27.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做什么都成"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can accomplish anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.29,1:14:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,山谷镇周六晚天气预报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Hill Valley area weather this Saturday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.59,1:14:35.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晴朗 有些许云彩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mostly clear, with some scattered clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.68,1:14:37.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,气温40度左右{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lows tonight in the upper 40s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.47,1:14:39.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定暴风雨一定会来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure about this storm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.22,1:14:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别相信天气预报 更别提未来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when can weathermen predict the weather, let alone the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.89,1:14:47.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 看到你走 我很伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Marty, I'm going to be very sad to see you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.65,1:14:48.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你改变了我的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've really made a difference in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.94,1:14:51.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给了我奋斗的目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've given me something to shoot for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.15,1:14:55.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想想看 我会活着看到1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just knowing that I'm going to be around to see 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.40,1:14:57.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会成功的发明这个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I'm going to succeed in this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.41,1:15:00.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将有机会穿越时光!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I'm going to have a chance to travel through time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.41,1:15:09.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要经过30年漫长等待 我才能再和你谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to be really hard waiting 30 years before I can talk to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.17,1:15:12.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这三天发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about everything that's happened in the past few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.21,1:15:14.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会想念你的 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really going to miss you, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.13,1:15:17.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really going to miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.35,1:15:23.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 关于未来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, about the future...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.60,1:15:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.35,1:15:27.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我们已经认同了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! We've already agreed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.77,1:15:29.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道未来的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that having information about the future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.15,1:15:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是相当危险的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can be extremely dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.69,1:15:32.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管你一片好心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if your intentions are good,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.27,1:15:34.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但结果也许相反的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it can backfire drastically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.48,1:15:36.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你所要告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you've got to tell me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.78,1:15:39.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会通过时间理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find out through the natural course of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.91,1:15:42.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"亲爱的布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Dr. Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.62,1:15:46.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我回去的那晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the night that I go back in time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.54,1:15:48.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:51.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被恐怖分子枪杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shot by terrorists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.29,1:15:54.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请采取防范措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please take whatever precautions are necessary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.84,1:15:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,防止这可怕的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prevent this terrible disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.72,1:16:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.47,1:16:02.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.33,1:16:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(请在 1985年开封)
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.15,1:16:15.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好 布朗博士 这电线干什么用的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Evening, Dr. Brown. What's with the wire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.19,1:16:18.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 只是个气象实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, just a little weather experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.95,1:16:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you got under here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.03,1:16:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别 别碰!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't touch that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.11,1:16:24.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是非常敏感的气象传感器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some new, specialized weather-sensing equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.99,1:16:27.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有许可证吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a permit for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.29,1:16:28.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.05,1:16:39.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 待我查看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a second. Let me see if I can find it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.01,1:16:48.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(魅力海洋舞会)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.31,1:17:35.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你介不介意我们停车...亲热一阵?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if we park for a while?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.11,1:17:39.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意 我喜欢在车里亲热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a great idea. I'd love to park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.28,1:17:42.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我快18岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I'm almost 18 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.07,1:17:44.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是从来没跟人在车里亲热过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like I've never parked before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.78,1:17:47.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.62,1:17:50.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你很紧张 出什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you seem so nervous. Is something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.70,1:17:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.75,1:18:01.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲 洛莲 你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine! Lorraine, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.63,1:18:03.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从老妈酒柜里弄到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swiped it from the old lady's liquor cabinet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.05,1:18:06.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 你不能喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you shouldn't drink.{\r}
