Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.10,1:18:09.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.89,1:18:12.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会为此后悔一辈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might regret it later in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.68,1:18:15.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这么保守!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, don't be such a square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.69,1:18:17.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里人人都喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody who's anybody drinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.78,1:18:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你还抽烟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, you smoke, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:28.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你开始像我妈妈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're beginning to sound just like my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.21,1:18:41.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,休息一会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to take a little break,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:43.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快就回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we'll be back in a while,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.21,1:18:45.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家请别走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so don't nobody go nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.19,1:19:05.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁? 为什么你这么紧张?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty? Why are you so nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.74,1:19:08.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.03,1:19:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否遇到过这样的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever been in a situation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.29,1:19:15.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做一件事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you knew you had to act a certain way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.16,1:19:17.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当事到临头 却不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when you got there, you didn't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.42,1:19:19.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如何是好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you could go through with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.25,1:19:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 第一次约会不知该怎么做吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean like how you're supposed to act on a first date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.80,1:19:24.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也可以这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.84,1:19:27.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我很清楚你的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know exactly what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.34,1:19:29.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:32.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那情况下我怎样做 你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I do in those situations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:33.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.06,1:19:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.12,1:19:56.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全错了 我不知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all wrong. I don't know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.41,1:20:01.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我吻你 就像是在吻...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when I kiss you, it's like I'm kissing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.67,1:20:05.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.34,1:20:08.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何感觉 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that doesn't make any sense, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.13,1:20:12.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有 感觉相当不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, it makes perfect sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.97,1:20:15.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.60,1:20:23.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你害我花了300美元修车费 你这个狗娘养的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You caused 300 bucks damage to my car, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:27.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你的屁股来偿还!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm going to take it out of your ass. Hold him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.11,1:20:30.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他走 贝夫 你醉了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go, Biff. You're drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:33.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 谁在这啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look-ey what we have here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.62,1:20:40.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别走 到我这来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! You're staying right here with me. Come on, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.33,1:20:41.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.46,1:20:42.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开她 你这杂种!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave her alone, you bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.79,1:20:44.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带到后面去 我马上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him in back, all right? I'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.71,1:20:47.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别害臊啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just admit that you want it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.88,1:20:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去 有什么好看的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go on. This ain't no peep show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.93,1:20:58.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, let's put him in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.94,1:21:03.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是弄坏我头发的代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for messing up my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.35,1:21:05.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在我车里干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing to my car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.52,1:21:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑鬼 这没你的事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, beat it, spook. This don't concern you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.57,1:21:13.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喊谁黑鬼呢 你这呆瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you calling "spook," peckerwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.62,1:21:16.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 听着 伙计...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, listen, guys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.37,1:21:18.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 我可不想找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't want to mess with no reefer addicts, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.04,1:21:20.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回去找你们的母亲去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get home to your mama, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.96,1:21:22.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.12,1:21:23.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 贝夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.75,1:21:25.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放我出去! 救救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.38,1:21:28.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的钥匙在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reginald, where are your keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.96,1:21:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在行李箱里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The keys are in the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.59,1:21:32.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say that again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.80,1:21:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说钥匙就在我这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, the keys are in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.36,1:21:49.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.74,1:21:54.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你! 把那该死的手拿开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you, get your damn hands off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.70,1:22:00.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你弄错车子了吧 麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you got the wrong car, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.62,1:22:03.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 救救我 求你了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, help me! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.75,1:22:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,转过身 然后走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just turn around, McFly, and walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.67,1:22:08.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 救救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.75,1:22:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你聋了吗 麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you deaf, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.92,1:22:12.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关上车门 转过身去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the door and beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.59,1:22:18.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 贝夫! 你放开她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Biff. You leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.93,1:22:20.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.98,1:22:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是你自找的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking for it, and now you're going to get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.02,1:22:30.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.53,1:22:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把他的手弄断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff, you'll break his arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.28,1:22:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.36,1:22:39.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand here, Reginald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.99,1:22:43.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 我的手刮伤了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, man! I sliced my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.37,1:22:44.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁的钥匙? - 我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whose are these? - Mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.17,1:22:50.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把他的手弄断了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to break his arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.71,1:22:53.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 放开他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff! Biff, leave him alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.92,1:22:56.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go! Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.54,1:23:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.19,1:23:53.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.61,1:23:54.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.65,1:24:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个 乔治·麦佛莱 吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.78,1:24:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,借过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.34,1:24:14.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,暴风雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.80,1:24:19.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计 你们得回去 完成演奏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys, you gotta get back in there and finish the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.59,1:24:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 看马文的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man. Look at Marvin's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.09,1:24:22.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能弹吉他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't play with his hand like that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.30,1:24:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能没有他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we can't play without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.51,1:24:25.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马文 你必须去演奏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well. Look, Marvin, you got to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.06,1:24:28.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们第一次站在舞池里接吻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's where they kiss for the first time on the dance floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.31,1:24:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没音乐他们就没法跳舞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if there's no music, they can't dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不跳舞 他们就不会接吻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they can't dance, they can't kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.48,1:24:33.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不接吻 他们就不会相恋 那我就完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they can't kiss, they can't fall in love and I'm history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.94,1:24:35.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 舞会完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, the dance is over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.19,1:24:37.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你找到别人演奏吉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you know somebody else that can play the guitar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.12,1:24:47.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这首曲子献给所有情人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for all you lovers out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.12,1:24:54.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 凡间天使 凡间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Earth angel, Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.92,1:24:57.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 你会是我的吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Will you be mine? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.13,1:25:00.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ My darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.59,1:25:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 你要吻我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, aren't you going to kiss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.51,1:25:05.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.81,1:25:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开 乔治·麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scram, McFly. I'm cutting in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.94,1:25:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 人间天使 人间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Earth angel, Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.57,1:25:22.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我喜欢的那个 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The one I adore ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.49,1:25:24.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 你还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boy, you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没法演奏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.16,1:25:28.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.72,1:25:46.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.39,1:25:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.60,1:25:54.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.45,1:26:06.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 你对幸福的憧憬 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The vision of your happiness ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.24,1:26:11.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 凡间天使 凡间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Earth angel, Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.12,1:26:15.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 请属于我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Please be mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.92,1:26:18.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ My darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.38,1:26:21.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 永远爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Love you for all time ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.21,1:26:25.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我是傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm just a fool ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.55,1:26:29.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 爱上你的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A fool in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.85,1:26:34.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ with you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.11,1:26:45.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一曲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, man, that was good. Let's do another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.11,1:26:47.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.11,1:26:50.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 伙计 该来一首特别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. Let's do something that really cooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.70,1:26:53.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一首"特别"的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that cooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.88,1:26:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这才象话嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.00,1:27:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这才象话嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.01,1:27:06.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.30,1:27:10.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这是首老歌...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, this is an oldie, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.72,1:27:16.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我那个时代的老歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's an oldie where I come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.15,1:27:20.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把调定在 布鲁斯 b 调上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, listen, this is a blues riff in B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.48,1:27:23.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,注意变调 要跟上我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch me for the changes, and try and keep up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.46,1:27:43.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在新奥尔良路易斯安那的路上 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Way down in Louisiana Down in New Orleans ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.38,1:27:46.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 回到常青树丛中的树林里 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Way back up in the woods among the evergreens ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.26,1:27:49.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 那里有一个用泥土和木头建造的小木屋 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ There stood a log cabin made of earth and wood ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:51.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 那里住着一个叫约翰尼·B·古德的乡下男孩 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Where lived a country boy name of Johnny B. Goode ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.10,1:27:54.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 他从来没有学过读书写字 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ He never ever learned to read or write so well ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.77,1:27:57.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 他会弹吉他 就像他在敲钟一样 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ He could play the guitar just like he's ringing a bell ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.31,1:28:01.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.86,1:28:03.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.73,1:28:06.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.36,1:28:08.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 听说你摆平了贝夫 干得漂亮!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, George, I heard you laid out Biff. Nice going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.07,1:28:11.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治 你有没有想过竞选班代表?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George, you ever think of running for class president?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.45,1:28:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 约翰尼·B·古德 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Johnny B. Goode ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.20,1:28:18.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.96,1:28:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.71,1:28:24.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.54,1:28:26.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.34,1:28:30.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 约翰尼·B·古德 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Johnny B. Goode ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.47,1:28:35.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔希 乔希 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chuck! Chuck, it's Marvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.39,1:28:37.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你表兄马文·贝利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cousin, Marvin Berry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.06,1:28:40.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要全新的音乐吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that new sound you're looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:42.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来听这个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.34,1:29:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们现在还不能接受这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you guys aren't ready for that yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.64,1:29:58.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们的孩子会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your kids are going to love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.52,1:30:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.98,1:30:06.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 曲子很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, that was very interesting music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.65,1:30:08.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.77,1:30:10.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你不介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't mind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:12.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治要送我回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but George asked if he could take me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.61,1:30:15.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了 洛莲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! Good. Good, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.61,1:30:17.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有那种感觉了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a feeling about you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.49,1:30:19.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我感觉到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a feeling, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.83,1:30:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I got to go,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.29,1:30:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你 这段时间 很有教育意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I wanted to tell you that it's been educational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.04,1:30:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我们还会见面吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, will we ever see you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.71,1:30:31.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guarantee it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.01,1:30:35.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 感谢你的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Marty, I want to thank you for all your good advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.51,1:30:37.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会忘记的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.55,1:30:40.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 乔治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.52,1:30:45.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good luck, you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.02,1:30:52.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事 如果你们有了孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One other thing. If you guys ever have kids,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.03,1:30:55.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其中的一个在8岁的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one of them, when he's eight years old,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:58.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不慎烧坏了客厅的地毯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accidentally sets fire to the living room rug,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.87,1:31:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别对他太严厉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go easy on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.49,1:31:03.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.67,1:31:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"马丁" 多好的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty. Such a nice name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:19.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼! 那孩子到哪去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! Where is that kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.81,1:31:24.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.52,1:31:27.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼! 见鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.74,1:31:38.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你迟到了 你有没有时间概念啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late! Do you have no concept of time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.70,1:31:41.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 我得换件衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on. I had to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.16,1:31:44.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我能穿这样的衣服回去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I'm going back in that zoot suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.16,1:31:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸他成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old man really came through. It worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.91,1:31:49.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一拳摆平了贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He laid out Biff in one punch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道他怎么做到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know he had it in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.25,1:31:53.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一辈子从来没有这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's never stood up to Biff in his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.84,1:31:56.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.09,1:31:57.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的! 怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Why? What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:02.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 让我们现在定目标时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Let's set your destination time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.39,1:32:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你离开的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the exact time you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.10,1:32:13.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你送回到相同的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's send you back at exactly the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.44,1:32:18.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你一直没离开一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be like you never left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.41,1:32:24.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在街道的那边涂了白线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I painted a white line on the street way over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.91,1:32:26.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的出发地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where you'll start from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.87,1:32:29.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我精确计算了距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've calculated the precise distance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.29,1:32:31.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还考虑了加速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taking into account the acceleration speed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.04,1:32:33.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及风阻力的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wind resistance retroactive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.88,1:32:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你到达的时候 闪电刚好发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the moment the lightning strikes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.59,1:32:41.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准确的说 是7分22秒之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which will be in exactly 7 minutes and 22 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.47,1:32:43.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当钟响的时候 你就发动车子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this alarm goes off, you hit the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.93,1:32:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.81,1:32:54.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 都准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess that's everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.07,1:33:00.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.61,1:33:01.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.83,1:33:08.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,30 年后见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you in about 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.66,1:33:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.67,1:33:15.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.88,1:33:17.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你以时速88英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you hit that wire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.67,1:33:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接触到电线的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the connecting hook at precisely 88 miles an hour,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.84,1:33:23.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电刚好击中钟楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the instant the lightning strikes the tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.30,1:33:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会顺利的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything will be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.51,1:33:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.57,1:33:39.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the meaning of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.61,1:33:41.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,30年后你会知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find out in 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.36,1:33:43.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是关于未来的吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about the future, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.53,1:33:44.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是关于未来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's information about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.70,1:33:46.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.32,1:33:48.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you about this, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.33,1:33:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会导致因果关系的严重灾难!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The consequences could be disastrous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.25,1:33:53.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须冒这个险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, that's a risk you're going to have to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.75,1:33:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这关系到你的生命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life depends on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.42,1:33:56.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.04,1:34:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拒绝接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refuse to accept the responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.71,1:34:02.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样 我就直接告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case, I'll tell you straight out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.43,1:34:08.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.77,1:34:19.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿电线 我上去用绳子拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get the cable, I'll throw the rope down to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.90,1:34:21.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right! I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.89,1:34:57.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.78,1:35:06.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点! 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.45,1:35:09.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了! 拉吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Take it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.33,1:35:13.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.50,1:35:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.59,1:35:22.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.80,1:35:26.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须告诉你未来的事情!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to tell you about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.34,1:35:27.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.47,1:35:30.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须告诉你未来的事情!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to tell you about the future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.80,1:35:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.22,1:35:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我回去的那晚 你会被...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the night I go back in time, you get...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.56,1:35:41.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.07,1:35:52.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.16,1:35:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.33,1:35:55.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看时间!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.66,1:35:59.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还有不到4分钟了! 快去! 快去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got less than four minutes. Please, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.26,1:36:12.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.82,1:37:09.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼! 博士 为什么你要撕碎那封信?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Doc! Why did you have to tear up that letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.19,1:37:11.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I only had more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.16,1:37:16.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 我有的是时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. I got all the time I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.62,1:37:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有时间机器 我可以早点回去通知他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a time machine. I can just go back early and warn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.29,1:37:22.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 10分钟该足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Ten minutes ought to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:29.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间电路打开 通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Time circuit's on. Flux capacitor, fluxing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.13,1:37:32.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,引擎启动 很好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine running. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.05,1:37:37.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.64,1:37:40.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀! 别出乱子 快呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Not this time. Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.30,1:38:52.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.67,1:38:57.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发动吧! 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. Here we go. This time. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.10,1:39:01.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Please. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.32,1:40:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.88,1:42:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂的酒鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy drunk driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.10,1:42:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.86,1:42:41.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great. Everything looks great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.90,1:42:46.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1:24 还有时间 我来也 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1:24. I still got time. I'm coming, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.58,1:42:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, not again! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.10,1:43:10.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利比亚人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Libyans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.08,1:43:34.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.45,1:43:36.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.30,1:43:51.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.01,1:44:28.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.60,1:44:35.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.70,1:44:52.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.42,1:45:03.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,防弹衣?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bulletproof vest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.38,1:45:06.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.84,1:45:09.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没机会告诉你呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got a chance to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.81,1:45:26.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说会影响未来事件?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about all that talk about screwing up future events?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.94,1:45:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,破坏时空连续性?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The space-time continuum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.49,1:45:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 让这理论见鬼去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I figured, what the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.62,1:45:44.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你要去哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how far ahead are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.67,1:45:47.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,30年之后 很不错的整数字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 30 years. It's a nice, round number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.75,1:45:52.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记得去看看我 那时我47岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look me up when you get there, all right? Guess I'll be about 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.30,1:45:53.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.97,1:45:55.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多保重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.14,1:45:57.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.43,1:45:59.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Bye-bye, Einie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.27,1:46:03.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 刚到的时候当心点 有些颠簸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. And watch that re-entry. It's a little bumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.98,1:46:05.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.25,1:47:11.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是场恶梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.22,1:47:26.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是爸爸打电话过来 告诉他我今晚要加班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Paul calls me, tell him I'm working at the boutique late tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.27,1:47:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琳达 我可不是你的电话答录员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda, first of all, I'm not your answering service,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.44,1:47:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个克雷或是格雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}second of all, somebody named Greg{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.06,1:47:31.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久之前打电话给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or Craig called you just a little while ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.02,1:47:33.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是哪一个? 克雷还是格雷 ?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, which one was it, Greg or Craig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.69,1:47:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 你男友太多了 我可记不住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know! I can't keep up with all of your boyfriends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.49,1:47:37.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.66,1:47:40.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.12,1:47:42.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是早餐啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.70,1:47:45.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚穿着这身衣服睡觉吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you sleep in your clothes again last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:46.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.54,1:47:50.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这身打扮 戴夫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What are you wearing, Dave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.38,1:47:53.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我一向穿着西服去办公室啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I always wear a suit to the office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.92,1:47:56.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吗? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} - Are you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.55,1:47:58.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们得重赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we need a rematch, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.72,1:47:59.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重赛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rematch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.84,1:48:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我在作弊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Were you cheating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.97,1:48:01.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.05,1:48:03.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 早上好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.02,1:48:07.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.89,1:48:09.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伤到头没有? - 马丁! 没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you hit your head? - Marty, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.56,1:48:13.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们气色真不错! 妈妈你真苗条!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys look great. Mom, you look so thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.90,1:48:16.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 马丁 - 乔治!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why, thank you, Marty. - George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.90,1:48:19.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 瞌睡虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sleepyhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.91,1:48:22.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 戴夫 琳达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Dave. Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.37,1:48:23.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.83,1:48:26.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点忘了 詹尼弗·帕克 来过电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I almost forgot. Jennifer Parker called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.41,1:48:30.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢她 马丁 她是个可爱的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure like her, Marty. She is such a sweet girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.58,1:48:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是个重要的约会 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't tonight the night of the big date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.67,1:48:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What, Ma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.71,1:48:36.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们今晚不是要去湖边吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you going up to the lake tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.17,1:48:38.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为此已计划两周了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been planning it for two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.92,1:48:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 我们谈过这件事了 可我怎么去湖边呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, we talked about this. How can I go to the lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.68,1:48:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,车不是撞坏了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car's wrecked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.89,1:48:44.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撞坏? 撞坏?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrecked? Wrecked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.56,1:48:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候发生的? 怎么没人告诉我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did this happen? Why wasn't I told?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.76,1:48:46.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别吵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.85,1:48:48.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定车子很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure the car is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.43,1:48:50.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没人通知我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I always the last one to know about these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.77,1:48:53.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 贝夫 正在给车打腊呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? There's Biff out there waxing it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:55.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 弄得怎样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Biff, I want to make sure that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.77,1:48:58.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你打两层腊而不是一层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we get two coats of wax this time, not just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.69,1:49:00.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚打好了第二层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just finishing up the second coat now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.36,1:49:02.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 别骗我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Biff, don't con me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.45,1:49:06.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 麦佛莱先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mr. McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.58,1:49:09.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我意思是 我刚刚开始打第二层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant I was just starting on the second coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.75,1:49:14.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫就是这样 总是编故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biff. What a character. Always trying to get away with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.09,1:49:18.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在高中的时候就认识他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had to stay on top of Biff ever since high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.13,1:49:20.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, if it wasn't for him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.30,1:49:21.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还不会相爱呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never would have fallen in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.97,1:49:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.97,1:49:26.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱 先生 麦佛莱 夫人 刚刚到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. McFly! Mr. McFly, this just arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.76,1:49:29.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 马丁! 我想是你的新书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hi, Marty. I think it's your new book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.14,1:49:35.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你的第一部小说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey! Your first novel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.07,1:49:37.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I've always told you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.19,1:49:40.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"只要一心一意 做什么都成"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"you put your mind to it, you can accomplish anything."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.19,1:49:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Marty, here's your keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.78,1:49:44.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已为今晚约会打好蜡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all waxed up, ready for tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.16,1:49:46.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.68,1:50:04.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要兜兜风 先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a ride, mister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.39,1:50:05.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹尼弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.47,1:50:10.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真喜欢看到你 让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, are you a sight for sore eyes! Let me look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.35,1:50:14.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你好像一周没见我似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're acting like you haven't seen me in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.31,1:50:15.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,的确如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.31,1:50:19.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗? 一切正常吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay? Is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.86,1:50:23.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.20,1:50:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.21,1:50:46.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁! 你得和我回去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! You've got to come back with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.26,1:50:48.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.55,1:50:49.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.35,1:50:56.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 你在干什么 博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. What are you doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.48,1:50:58.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要燃料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.63,1:51:00.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(高能转换器)
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.03,1:51:04.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Quick! Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.53,1:51:06.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 博士 我才刚到这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Doc, I just got here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.66,1:51:08.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹尼弗和我正要开车去兜风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer's here. We're gonna take the new truck for a spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.74,1:51:11.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把她带上 这事也和她有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bring her along. This concerns her, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.08,1:51:13.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 你在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, Doc. What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.75,1:51:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens to us in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.87,1:51:17.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是我们变成呆子或怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we become assholes or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.71,1:51:18.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.92,1:51:20.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和詹尼弗感情很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both you and Jennifer turn out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.75,1:51:22.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于你们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your kids, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.30,1:51:24.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要帮他们办点事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something has got to be done about your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.93,1:51:34.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我们得倒车 没有足够长的路 加速到时速88英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, we better back up. We don't have enough road to get up to 88.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.10,1:51:38.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,路? 我们要去的地方 不需要路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roads? Where we're going, we don't need roads.{\r}
